269
00:11:13,630 --> 00:11:15,390
and other structures
that attach to bone

270
00:11:15,390 --> 00:11:17,890
make sure you study
the surface anatomy of

271
00:11:17,890 --> 00:11:19,810
bones as you will be
required to be familiar

272
00:11:19,810 --> 00:11:22,210
