material properties.

287
00:11:52,390 --> 00:11:54,490
Hyaline cartilage is
the most common type

288
00:11:54,490 --> 00:11:57,070
of cartilage. It is
semi-flexible, and

289
00:11:57,070 --> 00:11:58,650
here on the left
you can see the

290
00:11:58,650 --> 00:12:01,010
histology of hyaline
cartilage. It consists

291
00:12:01,010 --> 00:12:03,870
of chondrocytes in
a homogenous matrix.

292
00:12:04,390 --> 00:12:06,630
Fiber cartilage on
the top right is a

293
00:12:06,630 --> 00:12:08,950
much tougher, more
rigid type of cartilage.

294
00:12:08,950 --> 00:12:10,770
It contains fibers
visible in the

295
00:12:10,770 --> 00:12:12,570
