302
00:12:25,090 --> 00:12:27,350
Elastic cartilage
resists being damaged

303
00:12:27,350 --> 00:12:29,530
by being extremely
compliant. However,

304
00:12:29,530 --> 00:12:31,370
it has very little
strength or rigidity,

305
00:12:31,370 --> 00:12:34,070
and so it is not
a strong material.

306
00:12:36,050 --> 00:12:38,050
This figure highlights
the distribution

307
00:12:38,050 --> 00:12:40,390
of the three types
of cartilage. You

308
00:12:40,390 --> 00:12:42,190
should study the
distribution of cartilages

309
00:12:42,190 --> 00:12:44,610
and be able to
recognize which of

310
00:12:44,610 --> 00:12:46,650
the three types of
cartilage a particular

311
00:12:46,650 --> 00:12:48,830
