knee joint to rotate.

461
00:18:46,850 --> 00:18:48,930
Can the knee
rotate? Are there

462
00:18:48,930 --> 00:18:50,070
a limited number
of positions

463
00:18:50,070 --> 00:18:51,570
during which
this is possible?

464
00:18:58,290 --> 00:19:00,470
Tenovial joints can
be classified by the

465
00:19:00,470 --> 00:19:03,450
types of motions they
allow. In this example,

466
00:19:03,450 --> 00:19:06,170
