and circumduction.

482
00:19:39,610 --> 00:19:41,730
The knee, which we
mentioned earlier, is

483
00:19:41,730 --> 00:19:43,630
a special kind
of joint called a

484
00:19:43,690 --> 00:19:46,130
trochoginglimus, meaning
that it can flex and

485
00:19:46,130 --> 00:19:48,930
